OL,3,GNEWSABuilding site 'crush' not captured
OL,4,Aon CCTV - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe moment a delivery driver was
OL,7,Ffatally injured on a building site was
OL,8,Fnot captured on CCTV, an inquest has
OL,9,Fheard.
OL,11,FNigel Williamson was delivering large
OL,12,Fbags of gravel to the Kneeton Grove
OL,13,Fhousing development in East Bridgford,
OL,14,FNottinghamshire, using a crane-mounted
OL,15,Florry when he died last August.
OL,17,FThe 60-year-old, who had worked for KRM
OL,18,FBuilding Supplies, was found lying in
OL,19,Fthe flatbed of the lorry in pain, and
OL,20,Fsaid the words "crushed and crane",
OL,21,Fbefore he suffered a cardiac arrest,
OL,22,Fwitnesses said.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
